==Battleground==
*1 [[Shibalien]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns.
**1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Make sure to have all your [[anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] at 100% for all [[Into the Future]] Chapters. Without that, these enemies will be very, very tough. Luckily, no peons spawn during the boss battle other than the Shibaliens, which are limited in number. This is why even single-target attackers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] are worth using.

Try to get rid of Bun Bun Symbiote quick; his [[Wave Attack]]s can end your army. Lead him nearby your base to avoid attacks from Galactic Overseer Nyandam. A particularly good cat which can counter him easily is Octopus Cat, which not only is resistant to floating enemies and can weaken them, but he also blocks waves, which makes dealing with Bun Bun Symbiote much easier. Once you kill Bun Bun Symbiote, I.M. Phace and Galactic Overseer Nyandam should be easy.

